          "description": "List all active agents in the AIProx registry. Optionally filter by capability or payment rail. Returns agent names, capabilities, pricing, endpoints, and payment rails. Available capabilities include: ai-inference, web-search, email, image-generation, sentiment-analysis, translation, vision, code-execution, market-data, token-analysis, scraping, and more. 24 verified agents live.",
