          "description": "Run a task through the AIProx agent network. AIProx selects the best available agent for your task and returns the result. Supports async webhook execution: include callback_url to receive a 202 with job_id immediately — AIProx runs the task in the background and POSTs the result to your URL when done. Use get_job_status to poll for completion. Requires spend_token (Lightning lnpx_...) or wallet_address (Solana) for payment.",
